Step1: install pfsense and setup rsyslog ======
[Agent]> sudo apt install -y rsyslog
[Agent]> sudo systemctl enable rsyslog
[Agent]> sudo systemctl start rsyslog
Step2: 設定 pfSense 日誌接收 
[Agent]> sudo nano /etc/rsyslog.d/pfsense.conf 並新增如下
$ModLoad imudp
$UDPServerRun 514

$template PFSENSELOG,"/var/log/pfsense.log"
. ?PFSENSELOG
& stop
[Agent]> sudo systemctl restart rsyslog				# 重啟 rsyslog

====== Step2: Wazuh manager add pfSensor agent (ex: Ubuntu) ====

1. Click "Agents" icon --> "Deploy new agent"
 Choose the operating system: Ubunut
 Choose the version: Ubuntu 15+
 Choose the architecture: x86__64
 Wazuh server address: 10.18.106.146			# fill wazuh manager IP
 Assign an agent name: Ubuntu-pfSensor

2. Install and enroll the pfSensor agent
 [Agent]> cd ~/Downloads
 > curl -so wazuh-agent.deb https://packages.wazuh.com/4.x/apt/pool/main/w/wazuh-agent/wazuh-agent_4.5.0-1_amd64.deb && sudo WAZUH_MANAGER='10.18.106.146' WAZUH_AGENT_NAME='Ubuntu-pfSensor' dpkg -i ./wazuh-agent.deb

3. Open /var/ossec/etc/ossec.conf file and add a locafile for pfsense
 > nano /var/ossec/etc/ossec.conf
 # Add follow
   <localfile>
     <log_format>syslog</log_format>
     <location>/var/log/pfsense.log</location>
   </localfile>


4. Re-start the agent
 [Agent]> sudo systemctl daemon-reload
 [Agent]> sudo systemctl enable wazuh-agent
 [Agent]> sudo systemctl start wazuh-agent

